{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15311","headline":"送少微上人入蜀 · 李端","name":"送少微上人入蜀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"削发本求道，何方不是归。\n松风开法席，江月濯禅衣。\n飞阁蝉鸣早，漫天客过稀。\n戴顒常执笔，不觉此身非。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李端","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15311.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15311","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}